      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فدّاهُ</span></b> , (S, * K,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فدّاهُ بِنَفْسِهِ</span>, (S, * TA,) [or
both, for both are correct,] inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَفْدِيَةٌ</span>; (S, K;)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بنفسه</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَدَاهُ</span></b> , (S, TA, *) aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَفْدِيهِ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِدَآءٌ</span>;
(TA;) <i>He said to him</i> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِدَاكَ جُعِلْتُ</span></b>  [<i>May I be
made thy ransom,</i> i. e. <i>a ransom for thee</i>]. (S,
K, TA.)

